---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import GuideSignupForm from "../components/home/GuideSignupForm.astro";
import GuideSignupDialog from "../components/GuideSignupDialog.astro";
import { locations, navItems } from "../data/site";
import { calendlyLinks } from "../data/calendly";
import handPickingBook from "../assets/teachers/hand-picking-book.jpg";
import stoolInClearing from "../assets/teachers/stool-in-clearing.jpg";
---

<Layout
	title="Therapy for Teachers · Awaken Discovery"
	description="Therapy and gentle support for teachers navigating burnout, anxiety and nervous-system exhaustion — from Ally Donoghue, ex-teacher and counsellor."
>
	<SiteHeader navItems={navItems} />
	<main>
		<section class="teachers-hero section">
			<div class="container hero-grid">
				<div class="hero-shell">
					<p class="eyebrow">For Teachers</p>
					<h1>
						You Leave School. But School Never Really Leaves You.
					</h1>
					<p class="subheadline">
						You tell yourself you'll switch off when you get home.
					</p>
					<p class="subheadline">
						Instead, you're replaying conversations, thinking about tomorrow's
						lessons, worrying about the children who need you and wondering if
						you've done enough. You're exhausted, but your mind refuses to slow
						down.
					</p>
					<p class="subheadline">
						If teaching has become something you survive more than enjoy, you're
						not weak—and you're certainly not alone.
					</p>
					<p class="subheadline">
						Awaken Discovery offers a place to pause, understand what's happening
						and begin finding your way back to yourself. Whether you're looking
						for practical wellbeing support, reflective resources, workshops,
						groups or one-to-one counselling and psychotherapy, you'll find
						compassionate support designed with teachers in mind. No matter where
						you begin, every step is an opportunity to reconnect with yourself
						and rediscover who you are beyond the classroom.
					</p>
					<div class="cta-row">
						<GuideSignupDialog
							list="teachers-guide"
							dialogId="guide-signup-dialog-teachers-hero"
							triggerClass="cta cta-solid cta-guide"
							title="Why You Can't Switch Off — free teacher guide"
							lede="Gentle grounding tools for teachers. Enter your email and the free PDF will arrive shortly."
							buttonLabel="Send Me the Free Guide"
							pageLocation="Teachers · Hero · Free teacher guide"
						>
							<span class="cta-guide-lead">Download the Free Guide —</span>
							<span class="cta-guide-name">Why You Can't Switch Off After Teaching</span>
						</GuideSignupDialog>
						<a class="cta cta-outline" href="#support">Explore Teacher Support</a>
					</div>
					<ul class="trust-strip" aria-label="Credentials">
						<li>✔ Ex-Teacher</li>
						<li>✔ Counsellor &amp; Psychotherapist</li>
						<li>✔ Nervous-System-Aware Support</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<figure class="hero-media">
					<img
						src="/assets/images/ally-writing-journal.jpg"
						alt="Ally — counsellor and ex-teacher — writing reflectively in a journal at her desk"
						width="682"
						height="1024"
						loading="eager"
						decoding="async"
						fetchpriority="high"
					/>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="emotional-connection section section-soft">
			<div class="container ec-grid">
				<figure class="ec-media">
					<Image
						src={handPickingBook}
						alt="A hand gently lifting a hard-backed book from a stack on a wooden stool in a quiet woodland — choosing what to carry, what to put down"
						widths={[360, 540, 720]}
						sizes="(max-width: 960px) 80vw, 380px"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
						format="webp"
						quality={80}
					/>
					<figcaption>
						Some of it isn't yours to carry.
					</figcaption>
				</figure>

				<div class="ec-inner">
					<p class="section-kicker">Emotional Connection</p>
					<h2>When Teaching Begins to Cost You More Than You Expected</h2>
					<p>
						You may still care deeply about your students… …but quietly feel
						emotionally exhausted by the pressure, responsibility and constant
						expectation to keep going no matter how overwhelmed you feel.
					</p>
					<p class="ec-lead-in">Perhaps you've been feeling it too…</p>
					<ul class="ec-feelings">
						<li>The Sunday evening dread.</li>
						<li>The inability to fully switch off.</li>
						<li>The exhaustion that sleep no longer seems to fix.</li>
						<li>Counting down the weeks until the next holiday just to recover.</li>
						<li>Constantly giving to everyone else… while quietly losing parts of yourself in the process.</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						If this feels familiar, you are not weak — and you are certainly not
						alone. Teaching asks so much of people emotionally, mentally and
						physically. Sometimes the nervous system simply reaches a point where it
						can no longer keep carrying everything unsupported.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== FREE GUIDE — FINDING CALM IN THE CHAOS ============== -->
		<section class="free-guide section" id="free-guide">
			<div class="container fg-grid">
				<div class="fg-copy">
					<p class="section-kicker">A Free Guide for Overwhelmed Teachers</p>
					<h2>Why You Can't Switch Off After Teaching</h2>
					<p class="fg-subtitle">A calming guide for teachers who struggle to mentally leave work behind.</p>
					<p>
						A gentle, body-aware guide designed to help teachers better
						understand emotional overwhelm, calm the nervous system and begin
						reconnecting with themselves again.
					</p>
					<p class="fg-inside-title">What's inside</p>
					<ul class="fg-inside">
						<li>Grounding tools for difficult days</li>
						<li>Nervous system calming techniques</li>
						<li>Emotional burnout awareness</li>
						<li>Reflection prompts</li>
						<li>Gentle support strategies</li>
						<li>Understanding anxiety within teaching</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="fg-form-slot">
					<p class="fg-form-kicker">Email signup</p>
					<h3 class="fg-form-title">Send Me the Free Guide</h3>
					<GuideSignupForm
						list="teachers-guide"
						buttonLabel="Send Me the Free Guide"
						pageLocation="Teachers page · Why You Can't Switch Off After Teaching"
					/>
					<p class="fg-privacy">
						Your information will always be treated with care and never shared
						with third parties. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== MEET ALLY — TEACHER VERSION ============== -->
		<section
			class="meet-ally-teacher section section-soft"
			id="meet-ally-teacher"
		>
			<div class="container mat-inner">
				<div class="mat-text">
					<p class="section-kicker">Meet Ally</p>
					<h2>From Teacher Burnout to Emotional Healing</h2>
					<div class="mat-copy">
						<p>
							Before becoming a Counsellor and Psychotherapist, I spent over
							twenty years working within education.
						</p>
						<p>
							I understand the emotional pressure, overstimulation and
							exhaustion that teaching can quietly create beneath the surface.
						</p>
						<p>
							Awaken Discovery, Teachers was created to offer teachers a calmer,
							more compassionate space to pause, breathe and reconnect with
							themselves again — whether through therapy, emotional wellbeing
							support or practical nervous system awareness tools.
						</p>
						<p class="mat-emphasis">
							You do not need to keep carrying everything alone.
						</p>
					</div>
					<a class="cta cta-outline mat-cta" href="/about">Learn More About Ally</a>
				</div>
				<figure class="mat-figure">
					<img
						src="/assets/images/ally-portrait-sofa.jpg"
						alt="Ally — Counsellor, Psychotherapist and former teacher at Awaken Discovery"
						width="768"
						height="1024"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
					/>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== SUPPORT BEYOND SURVIVAL MODE — 4 CARDS ============== -->
		<section class="support-beyond section" id="support">
			<div class="container">
				<header class="sb-head">
					<p class="section-kicker">Resources &amp; Support</p>
					<h2>Support Beyond Survival Mode</h2>
					<p class="sb-intro">
						Whether you need immediate calming tools, deeper emotional
						reflection or ongoing support, Awaken Discovery, Teacher offers
						gentle resources designed specifically for overwhelmed teachers.
					</p>
				</header>

				<div class="sb-grid">
					<article class="sb-card sb-card--featured">
						<p class="sb-tag">Free Teacher Guide</p>
						<h3>Why You Can't Switch Off After Teaching</h3>
						<p>
							A calming guide to understanding emotional overload, nervous
							system exhaustion and why teaching can become so difficult to
							mentally leave behind at the end of the day.
						</p>
						<GuideSignupDialog
							list="teachers-guide"
							dialogId="guide-signup-dialog-teachers-support"
							triggerClass="sb-link"
							triggerLabel="Download the Free Guide →"
							title="Why You Can't Switch Off — free teacher guide"
							lede="Gentle grounding tools for teachers. Enter your email and the free PDF will arrive shortly."
							buttonLabel="Send Me the Free Guide"
							pageLocation="Teachers · Support & Beyond · Free teacher guide"
						/>
					</article>

					<article class="sb-card">
						<p class="sb-tag">Guided PDF · £37</p>
						<h3>The Teacher Realignment System</h3>
						<p>
							A guided PDF workbook for teachers who struggle to switch off,
							carry school home, or feel overwhelmed by the emotional demands
							of teaching.
						</p>
						<a class="sb-link" href="/products#teacher-realignment-system">
							Get the Teacher Realignment System
							<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
						</a>
					</article>

					<article class="sb-card">
						<p class="sb-tag">Group Wellbeing · £25</p>
						<h3>Sunday Reset for Teachers</h3>
						<p>
							A gentle online workshop on the last Sunday of every month —
							practical tools to decompress, settle Sunday anxiety and begin
							the week feeling calmer. Listen, reflect, and take what helps.
						</p>
						<a class="sb-link" href="/sunday-reset">
							Learn about the Reset
							<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
						</a>
					</article>

					<article class="sb-card">
						<p class="sb-tag">1-to-1 Therapy</p>
						<h3>One-to-One Therapy Support</h3>
						<p>
							A compassionate space to explore anxiety, burnout, overwhelm and
							life beyond constantly pushing through.
						</p>
						<a
							class="sb-link"
							href={calendlyLinks.tasterSession}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Begin Therapy Support
							<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
						</a>
					</article>
				</div>

				<aside class="sb-more">
					<div class="sb-more-copy">
						<p class="section-kicker">In the works</p>
						<h3>More Teacher Wellbeing Resources Are Currently Being Developed</h3>
						<p>
							Awaken Discovery is continuing to create supportive tools, guided
							audios and wellbeing resources for teachers navigating anxiety,
							overwhelm and emotional exhaustion.
						</p>
					</div>
					<a class="cta cta-outline sb-more-cta" href="#free-guide">
						Join the email community
					</a>
				</aside>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- ============== FINAL CTA — BREAKING POINT ============== -->
		<section class="cta-final section" id="begin">
			<div class="container cf-grid">
				<div class="cf-copy">
					<p class="section-kicker">Begin when you're ready</p>
					<h2>You Do Not Need to Reach Breaking Point Before Seeking Support</h2>
					<p>
						Whether you are trying to survive the term, questioning your future
						in teaching or simply feeling emotionally exhausted beneath the
						pressure of holding everything together, support is available.
					</p>
					<div class="cf-buttons">
						<GuideSignupDialog
							list="teachers-guide"
							dialogId="guide-signup-dialog-teachers-final"
							triggerClass="cta cta-solid"
							triggerLabel="Download the Free Guide"
							title="Why You Can't Switch Off — free teacher guide"
							lede="Gentle grounding tools for teachers. Enter your email and the free PDF will arrive shortly."
							buttonLabel="Send Me the Free Guide"
							pageLocation="Teachers · Final CTA · Free teacher guide"
						/>
						<a
							class="cta cta-outline"
							href={calendlyLinks.individual.sixtyFaceToFace}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Book a session
						</a>
						<a
							class="cta cta-outline"
							href={calendlyLinks.tasterSession}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Book a Free Consultation
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<figure class="cf-media">
					<Image
						src={stoolInClearing}
						alt="A wooden stool with a small stack of books sits in a quiet woodland clearing — a place to set things down"
						widths={[420, 640, 860]}
						sizes="(max-width: 960px) 80vw, 440px"
						loading="lazy"
						decoding="async"
						format="webp"
						quality={80}
					/>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<SiteFooter
		locations={locations}
		tagline="Helping overwhelmed teachers reconnect with themselves beyond survival mode."
	/>
</Layout>

<style>
	.teachers-hero {
		padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vh, 6rem);
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-white) 0%, #f6f8f6 100%);
	}

	.hero-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
		gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0.7rem 0 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4.4vw, 3.1rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1.16;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.subheadline {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.9vw, 1.2rem);
		line-height: 1.75;
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.subheadline + .subheadline {
		margin-top: 0.85rem;
	}

	.cta-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		margin-top: 1.6rem;
	}

	/* Button lives in GuideSignupDialog — style via :global */
	.cta-row :global(.cta-guide) {
		display: inline-flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 0.35rem;
		padding-block: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.cta-guide-name {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.trust-strip {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
		margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	.hero-media {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.hero-media :global(img) {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: 50% 40%;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgb(29 35 39 / 14%);
	}

	/* ---------- EMOTIONAL CONNECTION (image left, text right) ---------- */
	.ec-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.ec-inner {
		max-width: 60ch;
	}

	.ec-media {
		margin: 0;
		position: sticky;
		top: 6rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.7rem;
	}

	.ec-media :global(img) {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgb(0 94 71 / 14%);
	}

	.ec-media figcaption {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.45;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		text-align: center;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.section-kicker {
		margin: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.3vw, 2.4rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.ec-inner p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.ec-lead-in {
		margin-top: 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
	}

	.ec-feelings {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.65rem;
	}

	.ec-feelings li {
		position: relative;
		padding-left: 1.4rem;
		line-height: 1.65;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--color-dark-gray);
	}

	.ec-feelings li::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0.7em;
		width: 0.55rem;
		height: 0.55rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		opacity: 0.55;
	}

	/* ---------- FREE GUIDE ---------- */
	.free-guide {
		background: var(--color-white);
	}

	.fg-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
		gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.fg-copy {
		max-width: 56ch;
	}

	.fg-subtitle {
		margin: -0.4rem 0 1.2rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
	}

	.fg-copy p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		line-height: 1.85;
	}

	.fg-inside-title {
		margin: 1.6rem 0 0.9rem !important;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
	}

	.fg-inside {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.55rem;
	}

	.fg-inside li {
		position: relative;
		padding-left: 1.8rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.fg-inside li::before {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0.45em;
		width: 1.05rem;
		height: 1.05rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgb(0 94 71 / 12%);
		border: 1px solid rgb(0 94 71 / 28%);
	}

	.fg-inside li::after {
		content: "";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0.32rem;
		top: 0.78em;
		width: 0.32rem;
		height: 0.18rem;
		border-left: 1.6px solid var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		border-bottom: 1.6px solid var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		transform: rotate(-45deg);
	}

	.fg-form-slot {
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f8f6 0%, #eaf0ea 100%);
		padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid rgb(0 94 71 / 18%);
		box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgb(0 94 71 / 10%);
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.95rem;
		position: sticky;
		top: 6rem;
	}

	.fg-form-kicker {
		margin: 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
	}

	.fg-form-title {
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
	}

	.fillout-embed {
		background: var(--color-white);
		border-radius: 0.8rem;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.fg-privacy {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		opacity: 0.8;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.fg-privacy a {
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}

	/* ---------- MEET ALLY (TEACHER) ---------- */
	.mat-inner {
		max-width: 1080px;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
		gap: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
		align-items: center;
	}

	.mat-text {
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	.mat-text h2 {
		max-width: 24ch;
		margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
	}

	.mat-figure {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.mat-figure img {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: 50% 25%;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgb(0 94 71 / 18%);
	}

	.mat-copy {
		margin-top: 1.4rem;
	}

	.mat-copy p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.mat-emphasis {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.2rem !important;
		color: var(--color-dark-slate-gray);
		margin-top: 1.4rem !important;
	}

	.mat-cta {
		margin-top: 1.3rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.mat-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.mat-figure {
			max-width: 360px;
			margin-inline: auto;
			order: -1;
		}
	}

	/* ---------- SUPPORT BEYOND SURVIVAL MODE ---------- */
	.support-beyond {
		background: var(--color-white);
	}

	.sb-head {
		max-width: 60ch;
		margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
	}

	.sb-intro {
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.85;
	}

	.sb-grid {
